<!--
  Hardened-runtime entitlements for the signed & notarized macOS bundle.
  Intentionally minimal: no App Sandbox, no JIT / unsigned-executable-memory
  grants. The webview's JIT runs in system-provided WebKit processes, not this
  binary, so the app itself needs no code-signing exceptions today.

  Binaries that DO need JIT grants get their own entitlements file at their own
  codesign step, never additions here: the bundled chrome-headless-shell uses
  browser-entitlements.plist, and the future local inference engine
  (llama.cpp / Metal) should follow the same pattern. Keep this file minimal so
  the app's attack surface stays small.
-->
